cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HHT in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HHT: a personal, local-first travel diary for iOS"
abstract: >-
  HHT is a private, local-first iOS app that works like a continuous household
  travel survey for one person. It records location in the background, rebuilds
  each day into visits, trips, modes and trip chains, lets the user correct
  mistakes in one or two taps, and exports a research-grade dataset
  (CSV, JSON, GeoJSON, SQLite) with a Python loader for analysis.
authors:
